#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:89
msgid "Measuring Focuser Step Size"
msgstr "Merjenje velikosti koraka ostrenja"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:91
msgid ""
"The focuser step size (microns per step, µm/step) is **critical** for "
"accurate tilt measurements. The Aberration Inspector converts focuser tick "
"differences between tiles into physical distance (microns). If this value is "
"wrong, the tilt magnitude will be scaled incorrectly (although the direction "
"will still be correct)."
msgstr ""
"Velikost koraka ostrenja (mikroni na korak, µm/korak) je **ključna** za "
"natančne meritve nagiba. Inšpektor aberacij pretvori razlike v oznakah "
"ostrenja med ploščicami v fizično razdaljo (mikroni). Če je ta vrednost "
"napačna, bo velikost nagiba nepravilno skalirana (čeprav bo smer še vedno "
"pravilna)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:97
msgid "Where to configure"
msgstr "Kje konfigurirati"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:99
msgid ""
"In the Focus module, open the ``CFZ`` dialog (Critical Focus Zone). The "
"**Step Size** field specifies how many micrometers the focuser moves per "
"single step (tick)."
msgstr ""
"V modulu Fokus odprite pogovorno okno ``CFZ`` (Kritično območje ostrenja). "
"Polje **Velikost koraka** določa, za koliko mikrometrov se ostrenje premakne "
"na en sam korak (oznako)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:105
msgid "Focus CFZ dialog showing the step size"
msgstr "Pogovorno okno Fokus CFZ, ki prikazuje velikost koraka"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:105
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_cfz_stepsize.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_cfz_stepsize.jpg"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:105
msgid ""
"The Focus CFZ dialog: step size is set to 2.754 µm for this ZWO EAF + Askar "
"SQA130 combination. The CFZ calculation (18 µm = 7 steps) uses this value."
msgstr ""
"Pogovorno okno Fokus CFZ: velikost koraka je za to kombinacijo ZWO EAF + "
"Askar SQA130 nastavljena na 2,754 µm. Izračun CFZ (18 µm = 7 korakov) "
"uporablja to vrednost."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:109
msgid "How to measure"
msgstr "Kako izmeriti"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:111
msgid ""
"If your focuser manufacturer publishes a specification, use it. Typical "
"values:"
msgstr ""
"Če proizvajalec vašega fokuserja objavi specifikacijo, jo uporabite. Tipične "
"vrednosti:"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:113
msgid "ZWO EAF: ~1.5–3.0 µm/step (depends on the scope's focuser mechanism)."
msgstr "ZWO EAF: ~1,5–3,0 µm/korak (odvisno od obsega mehanizma fokuserja)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:114
msgid "Pegasus FocusCube: ~2.0–5.0 µm/step."
msgstr "Pegasus FocusCube: ~2,0–5,0 µm/korak."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:115
msgid "MoonLite: varies by model."
msgstr "MoonLite: razlikuje se glede na model."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:117
msgid ""
"If no specification is available, or you want to verify it, use the full-"
"travel method:"
msgstr ""
"Če specifikacija ni na voljo ali jo želite preveriti, uporabite metodo "
"polnega hoda:"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:119
msgid ""
"**Measure the physical travel.** With the focuser disconnected from the "
"scope, use a digital caliper or dial indicator against the drawtube. Mark "
"the fully retracted and fully extended positions and measure the total "
"travel in mm."
msgstr ""
"**Izmerite fizični hod.** Ko je ostrenje odklopljeno od daljnogleda, "
"uporabite digitalno kljunasto merilo ali merilno uro ob cevki. Označite "
"popolnoma uvlečen in popolnoma iztegnjen položaj ter izmerite skupni hod v "
"mm."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:122
msgid ""
"**Count the total steps.** Drive the focuser from one end to the other using "
"the INDI control panel and note the step count for the full travel."
msgstr ""
"**Preštejte skupno število korakov.** Fokuser premaknite od enega konca do "
"drugega z uporabo nadzorne plošče INDI in zabeležite število korakov za "
"celoten hod."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Calculate.** ``Step Size (µm/step) = (Total Travel in mm × 1000) / Total "
"Steps``."
msgstr ""
"**Izračunajte.** ``Velikost koraka (µm/korak) = (Skupni hod v mm × 1000) / "
"Skupno število korakov``."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Example** (ZWO EAF on Askar SQA130): total travel ~31 mm, total steps "
"~11,250 → 31,000 µm / 11,250 = **2.76 µm/step**."
msgstr ""
"**Primer** (ZWO EAF na Askar SQA130): skupni hod ~31 mm, skupni koraki "
"~11.250 → 31.000 µm / 11.250 = **2,76 µm/korak**."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:132
msgid "Measuring focuser step size"
msgstr "Merjenje velikosti koraka fokuserja"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:132
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_stepsize_diagram.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_stepsize_diagram.png"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:132
msgid ""
"Drive the focuser through its full travel, measure the physical distance, "
"and divide by the step count."
msgstr ""
"Fokuser pomaknite skozi celotno pot, izmerite fizično razdaljo in delite s "
"številom korakov."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:136
msgid "Why it matters"
msgstr "Zakaj je pomembno"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:138
msgid ""
"Consider a sensor with 50 µm of tilt. The focus module might report a 20-"
"tick difference between the left and right tiles."
msgstr ""
"Predstavljajte si senzor z nagibom 50 µm. Fokuser lahko poroča o 20-delni "
"razliki med levo in desno ploščico."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:141
msgid ""
"With the correct step size (2.5 µm/step): 20 × 2.5 = **50 µm** → correct "
"advisory."
msgstr ""
"S pravilno velikostjo koraka (2,5 µm/korak): 20 × 2,5 = **50 µm** → pravilni "
"nasvet."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:142
msgid ""
"With a wrong step size (5.0 µm/step): 20 × 5.0 = **100 µm** → advisory "
"overshoots 2×."
msgstr ""
"Z napačno velikostjo koraka (5,0 µm/korak): 20 × 5,0 = **100 µm** → nasvet "
"prekorači 2×."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:144
msgid ""
"The *direction* of the correction is right either way, but a wrong step size "
"makes you overshoot or undershoot the magnitude on each iteration, requiring "
"more passes to converge."
msgstr ""
"*Smer* popravka je v obeh primerih pravilna, vendar napačna velikost koraka "
"povzroči, da pri vsaki iteraciji prekoračite ali premagate velikost, kar "
"zahteva več prehodov za konvergenco."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:150
msgid "Running the Aberration Inspector"
msgstr "Zagon inšpektorja aberacij"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:152
msgid ""
"**Achieve focus first.** Before using the Aberration Inspector, run a "
"**normal autofocus** on the full image (no mosaic mask) to bring the focuser "
"near the correct position. You need a good V-curve with a clean solution — "
"the Aberration Inspector sweeps around the current focus position, so if you "
"are far from focus the tiles will not produce usable data."
msgstr ""
"**Najprej dosežite ostrenje.** Preden uporabite inšpektor aberacij, zaženite "
"**običajno samodejno ostrenje** na celotni sliki (brez mozaične maske), da "
"fokuser približate pravilnemu položaju. Potrebujete dobro V-krivuljo s čisto "
"rešitvijo – Inšpektor aberacij se pomika okoli trenutnega položaja ostrenja, "
"zato ploščice ne bodo ustvarile uporabnih podatkov, če ste daleč od ostrenja."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:157
msgid ""
"**Switch to the Mosaic Mask.** The mask is selected in the Focus module's "
"settings. Open the Focus **Options** and find the **Mask** selector — it "
"offers *Use all stars* (full image, the default for normal autofocus), *Ring "
"Mask*, and *Mosaic Mask*. Choose **Mosaic Mask** for tilt measurement. "
"Adjust the tile size so each tile captures enough stars (tiles around 256–"
"512 px work well for most setups)."
msgstr ""
"**Preklopite na mozaično masko.** Maska je izbrana v nastavitvah modula "
"Fokus. Odprite **Možnosti** Fokusa in poiščite izbirnik **Maska** – ponuja "
"možnosti *Uporabi vse zvezde* (celotna slika, privzeta nastavitev za "
"običajno samodejno ostrenje), *Obročasta maska* in *Mozaična maska*. Za "
"merjenje nagiba izberite **Mozaična maska**. Prilagodite velikost ploščice "
"tako, da vsaka ploščica zajame dovolj zvezd (ploščice velikosti približno "
"256–512 slikovnih pik dobro delujejo za večino nastavitev)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Point to a star-rich field.** Open clusters are ideal. Avoid nebulae or "
"regions with few stars — you need multiple stars in every tile for reliable "
"curve fits."
msgstr ""
"**Usmerite se na polje, bogato z zvezdami.** Odprte kopice so idealne. "
"Izogibajte se meglicam ali območjem z malo zvezdami – za zanesljivo "
"prilagajanje krivulje potrebujete več zvezd na vsaki ploščici."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:167
msgid ""
"**Choosing a good spot in the sky.** Tilt measurement depends on clean, "
"round star shapes and steady tracking across the whole sweep. For best "
"results: pick a region with clear, well-separated stars and good contrast; "
"ensure good mount performance, since tracking errors or drift during the "
"sweep distort the per-tile HFR; and avoid areas where the mount tracks "
"poorly. Targets very close to the **zenith** or right on the **meridian** "
"can be problematic (near the zenith, small tracking moves cause large "
"apparent motion; on the meridian, some mounts track less smoothly near the "
"balance point). A field at a moderate altitude, well away from these, tends "
"to give more consistent star shapes for measurement."
msgstr ""
"**Izbira dobrega mesta na nebu.** Merjenje nagiba je odvisno od čistih, "
"okroglih oblik zvezd in enakomernega sledenja po celotnem območju. Za "
"najboljše rezultate: izberite območje z jasnimi, dobro ločenimi zvezdami in "
"dobrim kontrastom; Zagotovite dobro delovanje montaže, saj napake sledenja "
"ali zamik med pregledom popačijo HFR na ploščico; in se izogibajte območjem, "
"kjer montaža slabo sledi. Cilji, ki so zelo blizu **zenita** ali tik ob "
"**meridianu**, so lahko problematični (blizu zenita majhni premiki sledenja "
"povzročijo veliko navidezno gibanje; na meridianu nekateri montaži sledijo "
"manj gladko blizu točke ravnotežja). Polje na zmerni višini, precej stran od "
"teh, običajno daje bolj dosledne oblike zvezd za merjenje."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:177
msgid ""
"**Click \"Aberration Inspector\".** In the Focus module's Tools section, "
"click the ``Aberration Inspector`` button. This starts a dedicated tiled "
"autofocus run that sweeps through focus positions while measuring HFR in "
"each mosaic tile independently."
msgstr ""
"**Kliknite »Inšpektor aberacij«.** V razdelku Orodja modula Focus kliknite "
"gumb »Inšpektor aberacij«. S tem se zažene namensko samodejno ostrenje s "
"ploščicami, ki pregleduje položaje ostrenja, medtem ko meri HFR v vsaki "
"mozaični ploščici neodvisno."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:183
msgid ""
"Consider using a larger step size for the Aberration Inspector run than for "
"your normal autofocus. Because each tile has fewer stars, the per-tile V-"
"curves can look bumpy with small steps; larger steps produce smoother curves "
"and more reliable tile solutions."
msgstr ""
"Razmislite o uporabi večje velikosti koraka za izvajanje Inšpektorja "
"aberacij kot za običajno samodejno ostrenje. Ker ima vsaka ploščica manj "
"zvezd, so lahko krivulje V na ploščico videti neravne z majhnimi koraki; "
"večji koraki ustvarijo bolj gladke krivulje in zanesljivejše rešitve s "
"ploščicami."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:188
msgid ""
"**Wait for completion.** When all tiles' V-curves are fit, the Aberration "
"Inspector dialog appears automatically with the results."
msgstr ""
"**Počakajte na dokončanje.** Ko so V-krivulje vseh ploščic pravilno "
"nameščene, se samodejno prikaže pogovorno okno Inšpektor aberacij z "
"rezultati."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:193
msgid ""
"The Tilt Correction Advisory section within the Aberration Inspector is only "
"visible when either (a) a WandererAstro ETA is detected as connected, or (b) "
"you manually enable the **Tilt Plate** checkbox in the Aberration Inspector "
"toolbar. Otherwise the advisory panel stays hidden."
msgstr ""
"Razdelek z obvestilom o korekciji nagiba v Inšpektorju aberacij je viden le, "
"če (a) je WandererAstro ETA zaznan kot povezan ali (b) ročno omogočite "
"potrditveno polje **Nagibna plošča** v orodni vrstici Inšpektorja aberacij. "
"V nasprotnem primeru ostane obvestilna plošča skrita."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:201
msgid "Focus module after a successful Aberration Inspector run"
msgstr "Modul za fokusiranje po uspešnem zagonu Inšpektorja aberacij"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:201
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_focus_run.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_focus_run.jpg"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:201
msgid ""
"Focus module after a successful Aberration Inspector run: 56 stars detected, "
"HFR 1.32, R²=0.99. The mosaic mask grid is visible on the star field "
"(right). The ``Aberration Inspector`` button in the Tools section triggers "
"the tiled measurement run."
msgstr ""
"Modul za fokusiranje po uspešnem zagonu Inšpektorja aberacij: zaznanih 56 "
"zvezd, HFR 1,32, R²=0,99. Mreža mozaične maske je vidna na zvezdnem polju "
"(desno). Gumb »Inšpektor aberacij« v razdelku Orodja sproži meritev s "
"ploščicami."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:207
msgid "Understanding the Results"
msgstr "Razumevanje rezultatov"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:209
msgid ""
"The Aberration Inspector presents a per-tile table, a set of summary values, "
"and a multi-tile V-curve graph. (See the :ref:`Aberration Inspector <ekos-"
"focus-aberration-inspector>` reference in the Focus documentation for the "
"full description of every control.)"
msgstr ""
"Inšpektor aberacij predstavlja tabelo za posamezne ploščice, niz povzetkov "
"vrednosti in graf V-krivulje z več ploščicami. (Za popoln opis vsakega "
"kontrolnika glejte referenco :ref:`Inšpektor aberacij <ekos-focus-aberration-"
"inspector>` v dokumentaciji Fokusa.)"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:213
msgid ""
"**Tile table** — each row is a mosaic tile (region of the sensor): the focus "
"``Solution`` (steps), ``Delta (ticks)`` and ``Delta (µm)`` relative to the "
"centre tile, the ``Num Stars`` used vs. detected, and the ``R²`` goodness-of-"
"fit."
msgstr ""
"**Tabela ploščic** – vsaka vrstica je mozaična ploščica (območje senzorja): "
"fokus ``Rešitev`` (koraki), ``Delta (črtice)`` in ``Delta (µm)`` glede na "
"sredinsko ploščico, ``Število uporabljenih zvezd`` v primerjavi z zaznanimi "
"in ``R²`` stopnjo prilagajanja."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:217
msgid "**Summary values**"
msgstr "**Povzetek vrednosti**"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:219
msgid ""
"``Backfocus Δ`` — how far the sensor is from optimal backfocus distance (± "
"µm)."
msgstr ""
"``Ozadje Δ`` – kako daleč je senzor od optimalne razdalje zadnjega ostrenja "
"(± µm)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:220
msgid "``Left-Right Tilt`` — tilt along the horizontal axis (µm and %)."
msgstr "``Nagib levo-desno`` – nagib vzdolž vodoravne osi (µm in %)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:221
msgid "``Top-Bottom Tilt`` — tilt along the vertical axis (µm and %)."
msgstr "``Nagib zgoraj-dol`` – nagib vzdolž navpične osi (µm in %)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:222
msgid "``Total Tilt`` — combined vector magnitude (µm and %)."
msgstr "``Skupni nagib`` — kombinirana vektorska magnituda (µm in %)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:224
msgid ""
"**Multi-tile V-curve** — all tiles' V-curves overlaid. In a tilted sensor "
"the curves are shifted horizontally relative to each other; the minimum of "
"each curve occurs at a different focuser position."
msgstr ""
"**Večploščna V-krivulja** — V-krivulje vseh ploščic so prekrite. Pri "
"nagnjenem senzorju so krivulje vodoravno premaknjene druga glede na drugo; "
"minimum vsake krivulje se pojavi na drugem položaju fokuserja."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:231
msgid "Aberration Inspector multi-tile view"
msgstr "Pogled več ploščic v pregledovalniku aberacij"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:231
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_abins_multitile.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_abins_multitile.jpg"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:231
msgid ""
"Aberration Inspector showing all 5 tiles (TL, TR, C, BL, BR). The TL curve "
"(red) diverges significantly from the others, indicating the top-left region "
"is further from ideal focus. Total tilt: 30 µm. The 3D visualization (right) "
"shows the tilt plane."
msgstr ""
"Pregledovalnik aberacij prikazuje vseh 5 ploščic (TL, TR, C, BL, BR). "
"Krivulja TL (rdeča) se znatno razlikuje od ostalih, kar pomeni, da je "
"zgornje levo območje dlje od idealnega ostrenja. Skupni nagib: 30 µm. 3D-"
"vizualizacija (desno) prikazuje ravnino nagiba."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:237
msgid "Tilt Correction Advisory"
msgstr "Nasvet o popravku nagiba"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:239
msgid ""
"Below the measurement results, the **Tilt Correction Advisory** translates "
"the raw measurements into specific mechanical adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Pod rezultati meritev **Nasvet o popravku nagiba** pretvori surove meritve v "
"specifične mehanske prilagoditve."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:243
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:249
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Nastavitev"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:250
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:251
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Primer"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:252
msgid "**Plate**"
msgstr "**Plošča**"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:253
msgid "3-point or 4-point geometry"
msgstr "3-točkovna ali 4-točkovna geometrija"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:254
msgid "3-point"
msgstr "3-točkovna"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:255
msgid "**Radius**"
msgstr "**Polmer**"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:256
msgid "Bolt-circle radius in mm (centre to screw)"
msgstr "Polmer krožnice vijakov v mm (od središča do vijaka)"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:257
msgid "64.0 mm (ETA M54)"
msgstr "64,0 mm (ETA M54)"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:258
msgid "**Thread**"
msgstr "**Navoj**"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:259
msgid "Screw thread type (determines pitch)"
msgstr "Vrsta navoja vijaka (določa korak)"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:260
msgid "Wanderer ETA (0.50 mm)"
msgstr "Wanderer ETA (0,50 mm)"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:261
msgid "**Pitch**"
msgstr "**Strmina**"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:262
msgid "mm per full turn of the adjustment screw"
msgstr "mm na polni obrat nastavitvenega vijaka"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:263
#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:588
#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:667
msgid "0.50 mm/turn"
msgstr "0,50 mm/obrat"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:264
msgid "**Rotation**"
msgstr "**Vrtenje**"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:265
msgid "Camera body rotation (visual aid only)"
msgstr "Vrtenje ohišja kamere (samo vizualni pripomoček)"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:266
msgid "0° or 10°"
msgstr "0° ali 10°"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:267
msgid "**Mode**"
msgstr "**Način**"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:268
msgid "How corrections are presented"
msgstr "Kako so prikazani popravki"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:269
msgid "Push-only (from zero) or Relative (± deltas)"
msgstr "Samo potisni (od nič) ali relativno (± delta)"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:273
msgid ""
"**Setting the radius and thread for your plate.** The radius is the bolt-"
"circle radius — the distance from the centre of the plate to an adjustment "
"screw/motor. Known values are listed in `Supported Tilt Plates`_ below. If "
"your plate is not listed, check the manufacturer's website for a technical "
"drawing, or measure it yourself (centre to screw). The thread type sets the "
"pitch (mm per turn), which is only used to convert the correction into a "
"\"number of turns\" — an approximate radius still gives the correct "
"direction and a close magnitude."
msgstr ""
"**Nastavitev polmera in navoja za vašo ploščo.** Polmer je polmer krožnice "
"vijakov – razdalja od središča plošče do nastavitvenega vijaka/motorja. "
"Znane vrednosti so navedene v spodnjem razdelku »Podprte nagibne plošče«. Če "
"vaše plošče ni na seznamu, preverite tehnično risbo na spletni strani "
"proizvajalca ali jo izmerite sami (od središča do vijaka). Vrsta navoja "
"določa korak (mm na obrat), ki se uporablja le za pretvorbo popravka v "
"»število obratov« – približni polmer še vedno daje pravilno smer in "
"približno velikost."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:282
msgid "Modes explained"
msgstr "Pojasnjeni načini"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:284
msgid ""
"**Push-only (from zero)** — all values are shifted positive (minimum = 0). "
"Use when starting from a fully retracted / zeroed position. Recommended for "
"first-time tuning and for push-only plates like the ETA that cannot go "
"negative."
msgstr ""
"**Samo potisni (od ničle)** – vse vrednosti so pozitivno premaknjene "
"(minimum = 0). Uporabite, ko začnete iz popolnoma uvlečenega/ničelnega "
"položaja. Priporočljivo za prvo nastavitev in za plošče samo potisni, kot je "
"ETA, ki ne morejo postati negativne."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:287
msgid ""
"**Relative (± deltas)** — signed values to apply on top of the current "
"position; the values sum to zero (symmetric correction). Use for iterative "
"fine-tuning when the screws are already mid-range."
msgstr ""
"**Relativno (± delta)** – predznačene vrednosti, ki se uporabijo na vrhu "
"trenutnega položaja; vrednosti se seštejejo v nič (simetrična korekcija). "
"Uporabite za iterativno fino nastavitev, ko so vijaki že v srednjem območju."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:292
msgid "Visual diagram"
msgstr "Vizualni diagram"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:294
msgid ""
"The diagram shows the tilt plate as seen from **behind the camera** (the "
"side facing you when you stand behind the telescope). Points are color-"
"coded: **red** = increase / push out; **blue** = decrease / pull in (4-point "
"plates only). For 3-point plates (ETA): Point 1 is upper-right (rear view), "
"Point 2 is bottom-centre, Point 3 is upper-left."
msgstr ""
"Diagram prikazuje nagibno ploščo, kot je vidna **za kamero** (stran, "
"obrnjena proti vam, ko stojite za teleskopom). Točke so barvno kodirane: "
"**rdeča** = povečanje / potisni ven; **modra** = zmanjšanje / potegni "
"navznoter (samo 4-točkovne plošče). Za 3-točkovne plošče (ETA): Točka 1 je "
"zgoraj desno (pogled od zadaj), točka 2 je spodaj na sredini, točka 3 je "
"zgoraj levo."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:302
msgid "Tilt Correction Advisory, first measurement"
msgstr "Nasvet o popravku nagiba, prva meritev"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:302
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_advisory_run1.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_advisory_run1.jpg"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:302
msgid ""
"Aberration Inspector Run 1: total tilt 29 µm. The Tilt Correction Advisory "
"shows Point 1 (upper-right) +0.119 mm (+0.2 turns), Point 2 (bottom) +0.231 "
"mm (+0.5 turns), Point 3 no change. The ``Apply to ETA`` button sends these "
"corrections directly to the ETA."
msgstr ""
"1. izvedba inšpektorja aberacij: skupni nagib 29 µm. Opozorilo o popravku "
"nagiba prikazuje točko 1 (zgoraj desno) +0,119 mm (+0,2 obrata), točko 2 "
"(spodaj) +0,231 mm (+0,5 obrata), točko 3 brez sprememb. Gumb »Uporabi za "
"ETA« pošlje te popravke neposredno v ETA."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:307
msgid "4-point plate example"
msgstr "Primer 4-točkovne plošče"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:309
msgid ""
"For 4-point push/pull plates (e.g. the ToupTek M42 Tilter) the advisory "
"shows corrections for all four corner screws. Each screw affects both tilt "
"axes simultaneously because of the 45° corner geometry."
msgstr ""
"Za 4-točkovne potisno-vlečne plošče (npr. ToupTek M42 Tilter) opozorilo "
"prikazuje popravke za vse štiri vogalne vijake. Vsak vijak vpliva na obe osi "
"nagiba hkrati zaradi geometrije vogala 45°."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:316
msgid "4-point plate advisory"
msgstr "Nasvet za 4-točkovno ploščo"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:316
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_advisory_4point.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_advisory_4point.jpg"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:316
msgid ""
"Aberration Inspector with a 4-point plate selected (Radius 46.0 mm, Thread "
"M4 fine 0.50 mm, Rotation 20°). All 5 tiles fit well (R² 0.91–0.98). Total "
"tilt: 4 µm — nearly perfect. The advisory shows tiny corrections (Screw 1 "
"top-left −0.012 mm, Screw 4 bottom-right +0.012 mm) and an \"apply all "
"together, or Screw 1 alone −0.025 mm\" note."
msgstr ""
"Inšpektor aberacij z izbrano 4-točkovno ploščo (polmer 46,0 mm, navoj M4 "
"fino 0,50 mm, rotacija 20°). Vseh 5 ploščic se dobro prilega (R² 0,91–0,98). "
"Skupni nagib: 4 µm – skoraj popolno. Opozorilo prikazuje majhne popravke "
"(vijak 1 zgoraj levo −0,012 mm, vijak 4 spodaj desno +0,012 mm) in opombo "
"\"uporabite vse skupaj ali vijak 1 samo −0,025 mm\"."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:323
msgid "Applying Corrections (WandererAstro ETA)"
msgstr "Uporaba popravkov (WandererAstro ETA)"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:326
msgid "The ETA M54 tilt plate"
msgstr "Nagibna plošča ETA M54"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:328
msgid ""
"The WandererAstro ETA M54 is a motorized 3-point tilt adjuster with three "
"independent stepper motors and encoder feedback, 0–1.200 mm travel per "
"point, 0.50 mm/turn thread pitch, 0.002 mm (2 µm) positioning accuracy, and "
"USB-serial control via INDI."
msgstr ""
"WandererAstro ETA M54 je motoriziran 3-točkovni regulator nagiba s tremi "
"neodvisnimi koračnimi motorji in povratno zanko enkoderja, pomikom od 0 do "
"1,200 mm na točko, korakom navoja 0,50 mm/obrat, natančnostjo pozicioniranja "
"0,002 mm (2 µm) in serijskim krmiljenjem prek USB prek INDI."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:333
msgid "INDI control panel"
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča INDI"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:335
msgid ""
"When connected, the ETA appears in the INDI Control Panel with **Target "
"Positions** (set each point 0.000–1.200 mm), **Current Positions** (real-"
"time encoder readback), **Firmware** version, a **Zero All** action, and a "
"**Backfocus Offset** that applies a uniform offset to all three points at "
"once (handy for quickly compensating for the glass thickness of different "
"filters)."
msgstr ""
"Ko je priključena, se ETA prikaže na nadzorni plošči INDI z **Ciljnimi "
"položaji** (vsaka točka nastavljena na 0,000–1,200 mm), **Trenutnimi "
"položaji** (odčitavanje enkoderja v realnem času), **različico vdelane "
"programske opreme**, dejanjem **Ničelna vrednost** in **Odmik zadnjega "
"fokusa**, ki uporabi enakomeren odmik na vse tri točke hkrati (priročno za "
"hitro kompenzacijo debeline stekla različnih filtrov)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:344
msgid "ETA INDI control panel"
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča ETA INDI"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:344
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_eta_indi_panel.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_eta_indi_panel.jpg"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:344
msgid ""
"WandererAstro ETA M54 in the INDI Control Panel. Current positions show "
"P1=0.200, P2=0.400, P3=0.000 mm; firmware version 20251123."
msgstr ""
"WandererAstro ETA M54 v nadzorni plošči INDI. Trenutni položaji prikazujejo "
"P1=0,200, P2=0,400, P3=0,000 mm; različica vdelane programske opreme "
"20251123."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:350
msgid "ETA after applying corrections"
msgstr "ETA po uporabi popravkov"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:350
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_eta_applied.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_eta_applied.jpg"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:350
msgid ""
"ETA with a correction applied: P1=0.100, P2=0.330, P3=0.170 mm — different "
"values per point to compensate for sensor tilt."
msgstr ""
"ETA z uporabljenim popravkom: P1=0,100, P2=0,330, P3=0,170 mm – različne "
"vrednosti na točko za kompenzacijo nagiba senzorja."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:354
msgid "Automated apply"
msgstr "Samodejna uporaba"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:356
msgid ""
"When the Aberration Inspector detects a connected ETA (and the plate is set "
"to 3-point), the ``Apply to ETA`` button becomes active. Clicking it reads "
"the current ETA positions, adds the advisory delta to each point, shifts all "
"values to stay within 0.000–1.200 mm, and sends the targets sequentially "
"(Point 1 → wait for arrival → Point 2 → …). A confirmation is displayed, e."
"g. \"Applied to ETA: P1→X.XXX P2→X.XXX P3→X.XXX mm\"."
msgstr ""
"Ko Inšpektor aberacij zazna priključen ETA (in je plošča nastavljena na 3-"
"točkovno), postane gumb »Uporabi za ETA« aktiven. S klikom nanj se preberejo "
"trenutni položaji predvidenega časa prihoda, vsaki točki se doda delta "
"priporočila, vse vrednosti se premaknejo v razponu od 0,000 do 1,200 mm in "
"se cilji pošljejo zaporedno (Točka 1 → čakanje na prihod → ​​Točka 2 → …). "
"Prikaže se potrditev, npr. »Uporabljeno za predvideni čas prihoda: P1→X.XXX "
"P2→X.XXX P3→X.XXX mm«."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:365
msgid "After Apply to ETA"
msgstr "Po uporabi za predvideni čas prihoda"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:365
msgid ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_advisory_applied.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/ekos_tilt_advisory_applied.jpg"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:365
msgid ""
"After clicking ``Apply to ETA`` the status shows \"Applied to ETA: P1→0.119 "
"P2→0.571 P3→0.065 mm. Run autofocus again to re-measure.\" and the button "
"changes to \"Done\"."
msgstr ""
"Po kliku na »Uporabi za predvideni čas prihoda« se stanje prikaže kot "
"»Uporabljeno za predvideni čas prihoda: P1→0,119 P2→0,571 P3→0,065 mm. "
"Ponovno zaženite samodejno ostrenje za ponovno merjenje.« in gumb se "
"spremeni v »Končano«."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:370
msgid "Iterative Workflow"
msgstr "Iterativni potek dela"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:372
msgid ""
"Tilt correction is iterative — one pass rarely achieves perfect correction, "
"due to mechanical hysteresis, measurement noise, and the simplification of "
"treating tilt as purely planar."
msgstr ""
"Popravek nagiba je iterativen – z enim prehodom le redko dosežemo popoln "
"popravek zaradi mehanske histereze, šuma pri merjenju in poenostavitve "
"obravnave nagiba kot povsem ravninskega."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:377
msgid "Recommended procedure"
msgstr "Priporočen postopek"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:379
msgid ""
"Start with the ETA at zero (or all screws fully retracted for manual plates)."
msgstr ""
"Začnite z ETA na nič (ali z vsemi vijaki popolnoma umaknjenimi pri ročnih "
"ploščicah)."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:380
msgid ""
"**Run 1**: run the Aberration Inspector → read the tilt → apply the "
"correction."
msgstr ""
"**Tek 1**: zaženite Inšpektorja aberacij → odčitajte nagib → uporabite "
"popravek."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:381
msgid "**Run 2**: run again → the tilt should be significantly reduced."
msgstr "**Tek 2**: ponovno zaženite → nagib bi se moral znatno zmanjšati."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:382
msgid "**Run 3** (if needed): fine-tune to reach the target."
msgstr "**Tek 3** (če je potrebno): natančno nastavite, da dosežete cilj."

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:385
msgid "Example — real-world convergence"
msgstr "Primer – konvergenca v resničnem svetu"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:391
msgid "Run"
msgstr "Zaženi"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:392
#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:423
msgid "Total Tilt"
msgstr "Skupni nagib"

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:393
