msgid ""
"Manufacturer technical drawings usually give the screw positions in mm from "
"the optical axis — that distance is exactly the radius the advisory needs. "
"If no drawing is available, a caliper measurement from the plate centre to a "
"screw is accurate enough (the correction direction is unaffected by small "
"radius errors, and the magnitude scales gently)."
msgstr ""
"Tehnične risbe proizvajalca običajno navajajo položaje vijakov v mm od "
"optične osi – ta razdalja je točno polmer, ki ga potrebuje svetovalni "
"nasvet. Če risba ni na voljo, je dovolj natančna meritev s kljunastim "
"merilom od središča plošče do vijaka (smer popravka ni pod vplivom majhnih "
"napak polmera, velikost pa se nežno prilagaja merilu)."

